      <h3 id="hcp-matrix-platform_hcp-requirements" class="group scroll-mt-20">Hosted cluster platform support<a href="#hcp-matrix-platform_hcp-requirements" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
